{"sha": "c6125860312350293cf11ba645cb113261a4829c41517a26c498c8aeb4bfc7a6", "body": ["\\chapter{求导与凸性}\\label{ch:g12:deriv}", "", "导数刻画函数的瞬时变化率，它是函数图像", "在某点处切线的斜率。本章回顾并推广求导法则，", "建立 $f'$ 的符号与 $f$ 的单调性之间的联系，", "并引入由二阶导数决定的凸性。", "", "\\section{导数}", "", "\\begin{definition}[一点处的导数]\\label{def:g12:deriv:derivative}", "设 $f$ 定义在区间 $I$ 上，$a \\in I$。称函数 $f$", "在 $a$ 处\\emph{可导}\\index{导数}\\index{可导}，若差商", "\\[", "\\frac{f(a+h) - f(a)}{h}", "\\]", "当 $h \\to 0$ 时有有限极限。该极限称为", "\\emph{$f$ 在 $a$ 处的导数}，记作 $f'(a)$。若 $f$ 在 $I$ 的每一点处都可导，", "则称函数 $f' \\colon x \\mapsto f'(x)$ 为", "$f$ 的\\emph{导函数}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{definition}[切线]\\label{def:g12:deriv:tangent}", "若 $f$ 在 $a$ 处可导，则 $f$ 的", "曲线在点 $(a, f(a))$ 处的\\emph{切线}\\index{切线}为直线，其方程为", "\\[", "y = f(a) + f'(a)(x - a).", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, clip=false,", "  width=9.6cm, height=6.8cm,", "  xmin=-0.4, xmax=3.4, ymin=-0.4, ymax=4.3,", "  xtick={1,2.5}, xticklabels={$a$,$a+h$}, ytick=\\empty]", "  \\addplot[omProp!40, thick, domain=0.2:2.7] {1 + 1.75*(x-1)};", "  \\addplot[omProp!70, thick, domain=0.07:2.95] {1 + 1.5*(x-1)};", "  \\addplot[omProp, thick, domain=-0.12:3.3] {1 + 1.25*(x-1)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=-0.4:3.3] {x};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-0.4:2.72] {x^2/2 + 0.5};", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:1,1) -- (axis cs:2.5,1)", "    node[midway, below, font=\\small] {$h$};", "  \\draw[black, dashed, thin] (axis cs:2.5,1) -- (axis cs:2.5,3.625)", "    node[midway, right, font=\\small] {$f(a+h)-f(a)$};", "  \\fill (axis cs:2.5,3.625) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:2,2.5) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:1.5,1.625) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:1,1) circle (1.5pt)", "    node[above left, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small, anchor=west] at (axis cs:3.38,3.3) {切线};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 当 $h$ 减小时，过 $A = (a, f(a))$ 与", "$(a+h, f(a+h))$ 的割线（橙色）转向 $A$ 处的切线（红色）：其", "斜率 $\\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h}$ 趋于 $f'(a)$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}\\label{prop:g12:deriv:diffcont}", "在 $a$ 处可导的函数在 $a$ 处连续，其逆不成立。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "当 $h \\neq 0$ 充分小时，$f(a+h) - f(a) = h \\cdot \\frac{f(a+h)-f(a)}{h}$。", "当 $h \\to 0$ 时，右端趋于 $0 \\times f'(a) = 0$，故", "$f(a+h) \\to f(a)$。对于逆命题，$x \\mapsto \\abs{x}$ 在", "$0$ 处连续，但其在 $0$ 处的差商为 $\\frac{\\abs h}{h} = \\pm 1$，", "其值取决于 $h$ 的符号，故无极限。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\subsection{求导法则}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[运算法则]\\label{prop:g12:deriv:operations}", "设 $u, v$ 在 $I$ 上可导，$\\lambda \\in \\R$。则 $u + v$，", "$\\lambda u$、$uv$ 在 $I$ 上可导，$\\frac{u}{v}$ 亦然，", "其中 $v \\neq 0$，且", "\\[", "(u+v)' = u' + v', \\quad (\\lambda u)' = \\lambda u', \\quad", "(uv)' = u'v + uv', \\quad", "\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}.", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}[乘积法则的证明]", "将 $uv$ 在 $a$ 处的差商写为", "\\[", "\\frac{u(a+h)v(a+h) - u(a)v(a)}{h}", "= \\frac{u(a+h) - u(a)}{h}\\,v(a+h) + u(a)\\,\\frac{v(a+h) - v(a)}{h}.", "\\]", "当 $h \\to 0$ 时，由连续性得 $v(a+h) \\to v(a)$，", "（见\\cref{prop:g12:deriv:diffcont}），故右端趋于", "$u'(a)v(a) + u(a)v'(a)$。其余法则同理可证。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[链式法则]\\label{thm:g12:deriv:chain}", "\\index{链式法则}", "设 $u$ 在 $I$ 上可导且取值于 $J$，$g$ 在", "$J$ 上可导。则 $g \\circ u$ 在 $I$ 上可导，且", "\\[", "(g \\circ u)' = (g' \\circ u) \\cdot u' .", "\\]", "特别地，对可导的 $u$，有：", "\\[", "(u^n)' = n\\,u'\\,u^{n-1} \\ (n \\in \\Z), \\qquad", "\\left(\\sqrt{u}\\right)' = \\frac{u'}{2\\sqrt{u}} \\ (u > 0), \\qquad", "\\left(\\eu^{u}\\right)' = u'\\,\\eu^{u}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[证明概要]", "当 $u(a+h) \\neq u(a)$ 且 $h$ 充分小时，可写为", "\\[", "\\frac{g(u(a+h)) - g(u(a))}{h}", "= \\frac{g(u(a+h)) - g(u(a))}{u(a+h) - u(a)} \\cdot \\frac{u(a+h) - u(a)}{h}.", "\\]", "当 $h \\to 0$ 时，$u(a+h) \\to u(a)$，故第一个因子趋于 $g'(u(a))$，", "第二个因子趋于 $u'(a)$。（完整证明须处理", "$u(a+h) = u(a)$ 对任意小的 $h$ 成立的情形；此技术性问题", "留待大学阶段处理。）", "\\end{proof}", ""]}